* Task 3 fixture: SQL DELETE statement (WHERE + FROM table form)
* Demonstrates FR-20 requirement: SQL DELETE writes to DDM once
* Uses FROM clause to disambiguate from Adabas record DELETE
* Expected: one EdgeWrites entry for ORDERS (the FROM table operand)
* and zero edges for WHERE operands (they are host vars/columns)

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #ORDER-ID (N7)
  1 #STATUS (A10)
END-DEFINE

DELETE FROM ORDERS WHERE ORDER_ID = :#ORDER-ID AND STATUS = :#STATUS

END
